<h2>Media accreditation</h2>

<p>Media accreditation will be available to recognised news, business, trade and industry publications.</p>

<dl class="spec">
  <div class="field"><dt class="label">Application process</dt><dd class="value"><span class="value--pending">To be announced</span></dd></div>
  <div class="field"><dt class="label">Deadline</dt><dd class="value"><span class="value--pending">To be announced</span></dd></div>
  <div class="field"><dt class="label">On-site arrangements</dt><dd class="value"><span class="value--pending">To be announced</span></dd></div>
</dl>

<aside class="rail">
  <h2>Event facts</h2>

  <dl class="spec">
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Event</dt><dd class="value">{{ summit.name }}</dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Dates</dt><dd class="value">{{ summit.dates.display }}</dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">City</dt><dd class="value">{{ summit.location.city }}, {{ summit.location.country }}</dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Venue</dt><dd class="value"><span class="value--pending">To be announced</span></dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Theme</dt><dd class="value">{{ summit.theme }}</dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Organising body</dt><dd class="value">{{ summit.organiser.name }}</dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Organised by</dt><dd class="value">{{ summit.organiser.legalEntity }}</dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Media enquiries</dt><dd class="value"><a href="mailto:{{ summit.contact.marketingEmail }}">{{ summit.contact.marketingEmail }}</a></dd></div>
    <div class="field"><dt class="label">Named media contact</dt><dd class="value"><span class="value--pending">To be announced</span></dd></div>
  </dl>
</aside>

<div class="note">
  <p class="note__label">Reporting guidance</p>
  <p>As with any pre-event coverage, confirm these details against an official summit announcement before publication:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Venue and address</li>
    <li>Ticket prices and package benefits</li>
    <li>Speaker names and session titles</li>
    <li>Delegate, country or exhibitor numbers</li>
    <li>Institutional or government endorsements</li>
    <li>Partnership allocations</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<h2>Press resources</h2>

<p>The following resources will be added as they are approved:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Media fact sheet</li>
  <li>Official announcements</li>
  <li>Approved summit logo files</li>
  <li>Spokesperson biographies</li>
  <li>Speaker and partner releases</li>
  <li>Approved photography</li>
  <li>Programme overview</li>
</ul>

