    301s here. The one real file lives inline below; the exhibitor pack will
    live on /exhibition/stands/. Restore a downloads index at four-plus files.
    See src/_redirects. -#}
<h2>Downloads</h2>

<ul class="classes">
  {% for d in collections.downloads %}
  <li class="class-row">
    <span class="class-row__name"><a href="{{ d.data.file }}">{{ d.data.title }}</a></span>
    <span class="class-row__code">{{ d.data.format }} &middot; {{ (d.data.bytes / 1024) | round(1) }} kB</span>
    <p>{{ d.data.description }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<p>Logo files and high-resolution photography are available on request from
<a href="mailto:{{ summit.contact.marketingEmail }}">{{ summit.contact.marketingEmail }}</a>.
Photographs are on the <a href="/gallery/">gallery</a>.</p>

<h2>Using the summit name and logo</h2>

<p>Media guidelines for using the summit name and logo are being finalised. For editorial use, contact the summit team through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

<h2>Media enquiries</h2>

<p>Include your publication, role, deadline and the information or interview you require.</p>

<p class="section-action"><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact/">Contact the media team</a></p>
